What's new in 2.6.0
• Public URL (Beta): share your phone's AI server through a temporary link
• API tokens: create one per app or device, delete it to cut that one off
• Fixed: apps on your Wi-Fi could not connect to the server. The examples on the Server page now include your token, ready to copy
• Clearer error when an app sends a missing or wrong token
• Tap anywhere on the Share on LAN row to turn it on or off
